  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_017 (scvi_n200 RNA, ViT image, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) achieves the highest validation accuracy (0.724989). This experiment tests whether changing the RNA encoder to scgpt while keeping the image encoder as ViT, aggregation as avgpool, and fusion as weighted (config_018) affects performance. This isolates the effect of the RNA encoder choice, which is critical given scvi_n200's superior performance in previous experiments. It balances exploitation (building on the top performer's image encoder and fusion strategy) with exploration (testing a different RNA encoder)."
